{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Defense: Trappist</strong> is a top-down tower defense game with roguelike elements where you command a mech exploring the Trappist solar system searching for rare minerals. As you construct your outpost, you must balance between defending yourself against the oncoming waves of alien enemies and extracting the planet's precious riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build your base, mine rare minerals, and unveil new mech components and weapons to gain power! Design and upgrade your mechs to fit your playstyle and make them more powerful with each run you complete. Gaining experience to unlock power-ups will let you shape each run to be unique, but only by permanently making your mech faster, harder, and stronger will you be able to conquer the Trappist system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/8c76a665574b5534ba106e7103ab4d97.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your mech and defend against the incoming waves of aliens attacking your base. Steer clear of enemies by sprinting, dashing, and jumping away, or charge towards them to blast them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/669a78ea6e87fdfefa1796a6ccb7ed83.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span>Design, build, and customize your mech by finding new modules and weapons. You can modify your mech by finding new equipment, weapons, both ranged and melee, legs for speed, or radios to call down orbital support. Add your personal touch by changing the look of your mechs, choosing your favorite colors and parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/4f96bf631492a1fe96fa276719ad63eb.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the critical resources to build and upgrade your buildings and mechs. But you need to prioritize between resources or defense to survive the alien waves and get out with the goods.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/fd3a04eaa6e80b2dd78808b946602ae7.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span><strong>Joel Mull </strong>and <strong>Nima Khak</strong>, two renowned masters of underground electronic music, have created a thumping soundtrack to accompany your fierce mech battles. Having previously accompanied dark dance floors across the globe, this is the first time their unique compositions and sound design are being featured in a gaming experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Past The Splash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/70c9da54ae3d3c4b1a607b9af3a4e865510c6866.jpg"},{"name":"Visited All Worlds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/d87e377940d756ad34206f0017a698118744a219.jpg"},{"name":"You Annie Leibovitz There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/1293e0ceaaedc49a9f1137627903cce62eafe1eb.jpg"},{"name":"Picasso would be proud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/9ccd32379a7310af0ae6ae96d34434218e951020.jpg"},{"name":"Top-Level Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/0fa0f5eb654af8706bcde9ca665006ef6b13fece.jpg"},{"name":"Droid Army Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/c3b155e828be7d48ba65646532ae6eaafa0c4321.jpg"},{"name":"First Alien Killed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/f0d9ba3e55292b75e86a0ab6a63dde945ad3ce9e.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Aliens Killed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/e149d6ab0da468502ebf4c7b6e124d9643f17a51.jpg"},{"name":"1 Is a Tragedy, 10,000 Is Statistics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/2bf0d3f0406482eae01575db1989923900eaed0c.jpg"},{"name":"Core Charge Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3014930/6f38be3812a5b9fa66d59c093ff2c7bf4004ef67.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3014930?t=1759910168","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3014930?t=1759910168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/c508fb9e08f7a6b46cdeeffdcaa1e18b28538c78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759910168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/c508fb9e08f7a6b46cdeeffdcaa1e18b28538c78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759910168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave Defense: Trappist</strong> is a top-down tower defense game with roguelike elements where you command a mech exploring the Trappist solar system searching for rare minerals. As you construct your outpost, you must balance between defending yourself against the oncoming waves of alien enemies and extracting the planet's precious riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build your base, mine rare minerals, and unveil new mech components and weapons to gain power! Design and upgrade your mechs to fit your playstyle and make them more powerful with each run you complete. Gaining experience to unlock power-ups will let you shape each run to be unique, but only by permanently making your mech faster, harder, and stronger will you be able to conquer the Trappist system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/8c76a665574b5534ba106e7103ab4d97.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your mech and defend against the incoming waves of aliens attacking your base. Steer clear of enemies by sprinting, dashing, and jumping away, or charge towards them to blast them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/669a78ea6e87fdfefa1796a6ccb7ed83.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span>Design, build, and customize your mech by finding new modules and weapons. You can modify your mech by finding new equipment, weapons, both ranged and melee, legs for speed, or radios to call down orbital support. Add your personal touch by changing the look of your mechs, choosing your favorite colors and parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/4f96bf631492a1fe96fa276719ad63eb.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the critical resources to build and upgrade your buildings and mechs. But you need to prioritize between resources or defense to survive the alien waves and get out with the goods.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/extras/fd3a04eaa6e80b2dd78808b946602ae7.avif?t=1759910168\" width=800 height=150 /></span><strong>Joel Mull </strong>and <strong>Nima Khak</strong>, two renowned masters of underground electronic music, have created a thumping soundtrack to accompany your fierce mech battles. Having previously accompanied dark dance floors across the globe, this is the first time their unique compositions and sound design are being featured in a gaming experience.</p>","developers":["Neon Development"],"dlc":[3380850],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014930/header.jpg?t=1759910168","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Ventura or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1 or Intel equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> M1 or Intel equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any card will do</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014930/856817/0b601fdb155c5f4978057e695f2df3e9bc9544a4/1750957960/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742893189","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3014930/856817/0b601fdb155c5f4978057e695f2df3e9bc9544a4/1750957960/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742893189","highlight